      │ 			   ^^^^^^^^
    6 │ 			<a href="/about">About</a>
    7 │ 			<a href="/about/">About, with a trailing slash</a>
  
  i An <a> element reloads the whole document, so the client loses its state and downloads the page's scripts again.
  
  i Use <Link /> from next/link instead, which navigates on the client and prefetches the page.
  
